# What `docker build` never sends from caddy/ — the build context of the
# proxy's image. caddy/Dockerfile copies nothing from its context (Caddy is
# compiled from source by xcaddy, and the Caddyfile is mounted at run time), so
# the context is only ever the Dockerfile. This keeps it that way: anything
# dropped in here later, a secret or a key included, is never sent to the
# Docker daemon, let alone into a layer.
*
!Dockerfile
